Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.75,0:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what you're making. My dream time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.04,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it? I\Nreally don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away the crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there are no rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wild, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't do it, so\Ncan you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your wife that I\Nwant, but you're where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tells that you gotta keep your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you to\Nwhoop this guy good, soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.66,0:02:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.40,0:02:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're stoked to see your dad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, thanks for the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second can I trust\Nyou to stop Dopplamengo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you stop him promise me Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Lucy, I'm Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be king of the pirates one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.78,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What a load of nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.88,0:03:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your only opponent,\Nso turn and face me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of nerve!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.36,0:03:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you idiots\Nmake your way to Doofy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You tremendous pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, you traitorous brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.96,0:04:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, lol!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oopsy-nazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure took long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, your ability is pretty handy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It is, but it also takes\Na toll on my stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose on the bright side,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,between the sea prism stone cuffs and you\Ncarrying my ass all the way over here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can serve enough\Nstrength to pull it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Scalpel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He used lead bullets on\Npurpose, twisted jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to deliver that\Nass-kicking. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo isn't someone you can\Npummel with your sheer will alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to keep a level head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.71,0:05:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm cooling off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally fired off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, if you don't take my\Nadvice, you're going to be in for a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop bossing me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Rebecca I'd take care of him,\Nso butt out and let me handle it my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, reporting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have eyes on Straw Hat and Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're near the pool courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.88,0:05:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that. Call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.18,0:05:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent a decade of my life increasing\Ntheir numbers little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands of toy slaves at our disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But that imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroyed years of my\Nhard work in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Revenge won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a brush of my hand and pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Stryhat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,In that split second, it'll be\Nas though you never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.80,0:06:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this truly as calamitous\Nas it sounds, Sir Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time, Robin, she got turned into a toy\Nby Sugar and it was seriously messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even realize I forgot\Nher until she was turned back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sugar touches Luffy, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For us, he'll be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worse, even like your\Nfriend never even existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.84,0:06:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not let her win
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact them to transponder\Nsnail and one member.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been calling but it seems I haven't\Nnoticed yet It's not ideal, but here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make a long-distance\Nshot. You Jess or us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you shoot your target?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I I can barely see the palace from\Nhere, let alone someone inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, the walls alone would make\Nit impossible from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible or not, I've\Ngot to do it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, I will assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I take out enemies from\Nafar and protect my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain Tank and Hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.86,0:07:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,lend me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.32,0:07:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll provide cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a sea of furious\Npeople drawing closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,they are bewildered and desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they may even be coming from my\Nhead without harming a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.82,0:07:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,will stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm afraid that's easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,all we need to do is stall time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are they sounds like a plan to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,old king guy who's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,sugar is nearing your\Nfriends at a steady pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,they are in her line of sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,keep your eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it's King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take him straight to Dolce Lamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We must help him stem the tide. I concur!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar's there, right in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's go time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, none of us shall\Nrun, nor will we harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get distracted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta tell me her exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pull yourselves together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.20,0:09:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.38,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see Straw Hat through the one\Njust right of the most centered window.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's iron bar over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.90,0:09:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do the bars look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one vertical and three running\Nhorizontally from a glance. I'd estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.64,0:09:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That the bottom of the window is\Naround four feet off the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,which is approximately Sugar's height.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How big are the bottom two pains?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,15 inches tall by 20 wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar's advancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She should be in the\Nmiddle any moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If I miss, it's bye-bye, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can't hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but I really don't want to hit\Nthe seas without you, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, this kingdom needs you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This shot has your name on it, Sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way your family stops us here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,their auras!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything rides on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Super-grown-up-break-black-lambudo-special-long-reach-attack-back-warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.52,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A breeze flowing from west to east.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A wind force scale of four.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.42,0:11:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Got him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The first booster, exploding star.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A slight ascension, the rear disengages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Two seconds later,\Nanother booster fires off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The outer shell falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The ammo launches horizontally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rocketing at the rampart\Ntower towards the lower left pane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.52,0:12:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It soars through the\Nbars and stays on course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Steadfast towards its target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a direct hit,\Nbut that's intentional.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Its objective is to reignite trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you don't realize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep pushing ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.14,0:12:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Usopp, why you requested your\Nlikeness inscribed puzzles me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can turn it into a\Ntangible object, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.86,0:12:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.32,0:12:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna use it for ammunition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sugar! Ow! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She's knocked out gold again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Astounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You pulled it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are a remarkable sniper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This excellent work, who saw\NSugar is down for the count?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.18,0:13:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He is triumphant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed, sir,\NUSA—such an impossible feat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.19,0:13:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both fine—nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.86,0:13:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,nice work
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's hope they end the final battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my roost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please disregard the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting any company this late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So do tell me, what brings\Nyou vermin here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to whoop your sorry butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you fall apart?\NSomething happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.12,0:14:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that explains their giant stature\Neach toy was made up of several soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No qualms with turning your\Nown comrades into weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see how dastardly you have no\Nhonor. The trigger passed out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,come on, sugar, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta stay with us, please, sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awful—we thought\Nwe were going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,stuck as that thing for\Nthe rest of our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a little more faith in us—we were
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,going to turn you back as soon as\Nthe battle ended, without question!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:15:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, is that really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on us fools—they don't realize
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.20,0:15:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we too forgot that they\Neven existed! All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,my barrier is all recharged and ready
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to go—if you pinheads want to step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.78,0:15:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,want to step up Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy you'll have to get through me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.82,0:15:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No Bellamy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Concern for him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting you two had a fight\Nback in Mock Town if I recall right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you guys get so... chummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.64,0:15:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The time of pirate's dreams are over!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So when I see people chasing dreams\Nof One Piece, I get disgusted!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.84,0:16:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Bellamy go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for the victor to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.22,0:16:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This pitiful worm crawled\Nhere just to die. There's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,a big wave that's about to\Ncrash through this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think that doflamingo's\Nship can ride it out either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done laughing at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is a real hero of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been a fan ever since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I'll always respect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's about time for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,To take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thoughts, Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.38,0:16:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You worship the ground I walked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But when things got too\Ntough, you got desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry if you like, but people can't\Nchange the nature they're born with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.64,0:17:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad you'll never amount to\Nanything more than a dime a dozen thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.58,0:17:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy did change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You take that back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Set Bellamy free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.68,0:17:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.64,0:17:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't we just talk about this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, if you lose your cool,\Nhe gets exactly what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's provoking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.02,0:17:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Control your anger, or he wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time you lose your temper,\Nyou could wind up losing your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.42,0:18:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I foolishly found that out firsthand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo is a manipulative,\Nheartless monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Always looking to expose\Na moment of weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You kicked your dying buddy in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a riot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He sure see better days. Bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Right in the nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.74,0:18:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just goading you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you, law!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hurt—you think of me as\Nheartless, spiteful, maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and a man who loses his\Ntemper from time to time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but heartless—give\Nme a bit more credit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.18,0:18:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about the position\Nyou all put me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.46,0:18:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You started this by\Ndestroying my sad production.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,sad production
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.33,0:19:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you attacked both Vergo and Monet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You also abducted Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently you barged
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,into my home here in Dressrosa\Nand freed all the toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And at present, your people are currently
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,attempting to destroy my smile factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I tolerated your antics long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know I am still smiling\Nbecause i'm thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,what i'll do to you what's most\Ninsulting is that you think
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you can come up and kill me\Nthough i admit you have made my
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,life difficult it feels like i'm\Nre-experiencing the trauma of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.56,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened 13 years ago if\Nit wasn't for that moment i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,would have never come back seeking\Nrevenge on a twisted bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you, if it wasn't for that\Nvery incident, law you'd be here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:20:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Answering to me as Corazon, you\Nknow that's the undeniable truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Black Man gives him a show!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.32,0:20:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Another clone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that one, Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get the real Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.88,0:20:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Move, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.04,0:20:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we were cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I was sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats, he's being used like a puppet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:20:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.98,0:21:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how important this guy is\Nto you, but if you want him to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to knock his lights out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.62,0:21:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please throw a hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Another hit or two from your\Npal should finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.38,0:21:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like a fitting end for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember what I told you\Nall those years ago, Law?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Weaklings don't have the right\Nto decide how they get to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard, Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We came all this way and the\Ncoward won't fight us himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Trappy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.88,0:22:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.88,0:22:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our secret plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.76,0:22:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You never listen, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.98,0:22:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.42,0:22:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can strangle you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he going straight for law?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.38,0:22:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did his brain go mush\Nunder all this pressure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's too funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.28,0:22:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.30,0:22:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, shambles!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Hulk! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.10,0:22:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.74,0:23:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolphin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.04,0:23:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.54,0:23:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.45,0:23:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, radio knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.18,0:23:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.46,0:23:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are the worst, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.74,0:23:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just our generation.
